Device Monitor tracks devices seen on the OPNsense LAN and VLAN interfaces,
keeps a SQLite inventory of them and alerts on newly appearing devices by
e-mail (sendmail or direct SMTP) or webhook.

Ships a settings page, a device list, a Lobby dashboard widget and a
configd-managed background scanning daemon.

Device Monitor was originally written by Hacesoft (https://hacesoft.cz,
https://github.com/hacesoft/opnsense-devicemonitor). This package is built
from the maxysoft fork; all credit for the plugin itself goes to the original
author.

WWW: https://github.com/maxysoft/opnsense-devicemonitor
